(min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Battery Equipment" data-action="url" data-href="/collections/battery-powered-equipment" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fmzxHC NFAOU rid-149"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cMa-dPg gqnfAG rid-6"><a data-link="inherit" href="/collections/battery-powered-equipment" target="_self">Battery Equipment</a></h3></div></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Previous" style="visibility:hidden" class="pf-slider-prev none"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Next" style="visibility:hidden" class="pf-slider-next none"></button></div></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-2596" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-jwZJYP kKkRHp pf-67_"><div class="sc-boZfnm iHGCiB pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-68_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/5E8A9526-Russo-delivery-truck-naperville_500x.jpg?v=1748572169" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/5E8A9526-Russo-delivery-truck-naperville.jpg?v=1748572169 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/5E8A9526-Russo-delivery-truck-naperville_500x.jpg?v=1748572169 320w" width="1200" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo delivery truck naperville" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fmzxHC NFAOU pf-69_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-70_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cMa-dPg gqnfAG pf-71_">Why a New Brand Asset? Why Now?</h3><p class="sc-leXARK dphlZo pf-73_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">As Russo grows—both in footprint and customer diversity—we’re entering markets where people don’t yet know us. They haven’t seen our 50+ years of service. They don’t know that we bend over backward to get contractors back on the job, or that we service what we sell, or that we keep deep inventory year-round when others don’t.<br><br>So we asked: <strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">How do we introduce ourselves to someone who’s never heard of Russo?</span></span></strong><br><br>Outdoor Power Plus helps answer that. It pairs with the Russo logo&nbsp;and strengthens our first impression by clearly stating what we do—and hinting at all the extra value we bring.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-75_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-c415" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-jwZJYP kKkRHp pf-77_"><div class="sc-boZfnm iHGCiB pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-78_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse_500x.jpg?v=1748571743" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse.jpg?v=1748571743 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse_500x.jpg?v=1748571743 320w" width="1200" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo Elgin forklift warehouse" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fmzxHC NFAOU pf-79_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-80_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cMa-dPg gqnfAG pf-81_">Where We've Been: A Legacy of Service</h3><p class="sc-leXARK dphlZo pf-83_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">For over five decades, <strong>customer service has been at the core of Russo's success</strong>. In the Midwest, we're known for helping pros keep moving—fixing it, finding it, or staying late to make it happen. This brand was built on hustle, relationships, and respect for the working professional.<br></p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-85_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-e802" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-jwZJYP kKkRHp pf-87_"><div class="sc-boZfnm iHGCiB pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-88_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web_500x.jpg?v=1749231897" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web.jpg?v=1749231897 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web_500x.jpg?v=1749231897 320w" width="1199" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo_Schiller40-Dino-phone-BW-web.jpg__PID:b9073387-b7ca-4b96-b93e-c477214237e7" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fmzxHC NFAOU pf-89_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-90_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cMa-dPg gqnfAG pf-91_">Who We’re Talking To: Pros, Prosumers &amp; Landowners</h3><p class="sc-leXARK dphlZo pf-93_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our customer base is evolving. In new territories, we’re seeing more landowners, property managers, acreage owners, and serious DIYers—alongside our core pro contractors. That’s why the message must flex. <br><br>Our sales pitch—or as we fondly call it, the <em>barstool pitch</em>—starts with a question:&nbsp;<strong>“<span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Do you take care of your own property?</span>”</strong><br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong>•&nbsp;No?</strong></span><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></span></strong> Well, then we sell everything your contractor uses to maintain your grounds, landscape or snow.<br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong>•&nbsp;Yes?</strong></span><strong><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);"></span></strong> Then we can sell you everything a pro would use to maintain your grounds, landscape or snow.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-95_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-b5ef" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-jwZJYP kKkRHp pf-97_"><div class="sc-boZfnm iHGCiB pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-98_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale_500x.jpg?v=1785335411" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale.jpg?v=1785335411 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale_500x.jpg?v=1785335411 320w" width="800" height="1066" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale.jpg__PID:23ac8424-f8ea-4e6c-b55f-1786bb781b32" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-fmzxHC NFAOU pf-99_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-100_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cMa-dPg gqnfAG pf-101_">About the Logo</h3><p class="sc-leXARK dphlZo pf-103_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The Outdoor Power Plus brand asset was&nbsp;designed to complement&nbsp;the Russo logo—it reinforces our core identity while adding a fresh layer of meaning. While the two are often used together in a lockup, they don’t always have to appear side by side.<br><br>This flexibility allows us to honor Russo as the master brand while giving us a way to speak more directly in different markets. Whether on a store sign, in an ad, or across a digital campaign, this new asset&nbsp;adds meaning without taking away from who we are.<br> </p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-cTTcKX gXFeki pf-105_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-106_">"Outdoor Power" is familiar and instantly communicates our category.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-108_">"Plus"—in its distinctive script—signals retail warmth, openness, and more.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-110_">Together, they&nbsp;reinforce what Russo has always delivered: more parts, more brands, more expertise, and more support.</li></ul><p class="sc-leXARK dphlZo pf-112_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">It doesn’t replace Russo—it enhances it.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-114_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-ebff" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-jwZJYP kKkRHp pf-116_"><div class="sc-boZfnm iHGCiB pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-117_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-cMa-dPg gqnfAG pf-118_">What It Means to Us</h3><p class="sc-leXARK dphlZo pf-120_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Outdoor Power Plus is more than a logo—it’s a mindset. It’s how we:</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-cTTcKX gXFeki pf-122_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-123_">Serve every customer like they’ve been with us for years</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-125_">Grow with purpose</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-127_">Keep our word</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-129_">Stand behind what we sell</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-lmUbDS bJTyNj pf-131_">Equip the pros and empower the landowners</li></ul><p class="sc-leXARK dphlZo pf-133_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Whether you're meeting Russo for the first time or have been with us since the beginning, Outdoor Power Plus is your reminder that we’re built to do more—for you, for your crew, and for the future of this industry.</p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL pf-135_"><a href="/collections/power-equipment" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-136_ pf-button-2">Explore Our Products</a><a href="/pages/storelocator" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-138_ pf-button-2">Find a Russo Location</a><a href="/pages/all-season-contractor" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-140_ pf-button-2">Learn About What We Provide</a></div><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-jztuXx gHBAiw pf-142_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section style="--overlay:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)" data-section-id="pf-f58a" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-jwZJYP kKkRHp pf-144_ pf-container-1 pf-bg-lazy"><div class="sc-gJDa-DI fgHqKq"></div><div class="sc-boZfnm iHGCiB pf-flex-section"><div style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;--llo-xs:0;--llo-sm:0;--llo-md:0;--llo-lg:0" data-pf-type="ContentList2" class="sc-hTUXFl sc-lizKaK ffBGrU WeXnn pf-145_"><div class="pf-slider pf-c-ct pf-r-eh" style="--ss-xs:2;--ss-sm:4;--ss-md:4;--ss-lg:4" data-slider="{'navStyle':'none','maxHeight':true,'listLayout':{'all':0,'laptop':0,'tablet':0,'mobile':0},'slidesToShow':{'all':4,'laptop':4,'tablet':'4','mobile':2},'slidesToScroll':{'all':3,'laptop':3,'tablet':2,'mobile':1},'paginationStyle':'none','displayPartialItems':{'all':false,'laptop':false,'tablet':false,'mobile':false},'spacing':{'all':'30px','laptop':'30px','tablet':'30px','mobile':'16px'}}"><div class="pf-slide"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-czkhzk jmvOKx rid-80"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-iLLNPL dlsoZL rid-10"><h3 